  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are a quick study in the art of trapmaking.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Learn Ranger Trap<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You learn an additional number of ranger traps equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1). In addition, if you expend one use of your mythic power when creating an extraordinary trap, the DC is not reduced by 2.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc65\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
